 "_source": "questlog.gg Aion 2 crafting database (https://questlog.gg/aion-2/en/crafting): Elyos recipes extracted 2026-10-13, transfer recipes and Asmodian (Star Dragon) recipes 2026-10-15",
 "_notes": "Recipes for both factions: Elyos True Dragon (item keys ending 15 / combo 17, recipe ids like 111023001) and Asmodian Star Dragon (keys ending 19 / combo 21, recipe id = Elyos id + 10,000,000), which mirror each other slot for slot. Each True Dragon craft consumes 1 Artisan's Splendent item of the same slot (base_key) plus materials, and has a combo_probability chance to yield the Splendent True Dragon item (combo_key) instead. `transfer` is the slot's transfer craft (recipe id = True Dragon recipe id + 10): it turns a True Dragon item (product_key) plus its materials into a Splendent True Dragon item (bound_key) that is bound to the character and can't be sold. The dashboard shows it as a reference cost only: it's what a player can pay instead of buying a Splendent True Dragon item, so it caps what buyers will pay. questlog lists only the materials; the True Dragon item is the gear being transferred. Asmodian mastery_level is copied from the Elyos recipe of the same slot (questlog doesn't publish it). mastery_level is the recipe's crafting mastery level on the game's 1-100 scale (1-50 Novice, 51-100 Professional); the transfer recipe's level isn't published and is assumed to equal the True Dragon recipe's.",
